   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IOM201 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 8 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 14435 · Decision 968/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 07/08/2026 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IOM201 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>8 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 14435 · QĐ 968/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 07/08/2026 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>Define and explain the fundamental concepts, terminology, and operational processes in international operations management, including the Input-Transformation-Output model, the process hierarchy, and the 4Vs framework (Volume, Variety, Variation, Visibility).</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Analyze the strategic impact of operations decisions on corporate performance across five core performance objectives (Quality, Speed, Dependability, Flexibility, Cost) and evaluate market requirement trade-offs using the Efficient Frontier and Polar Representation.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Evaluate global supply network configurations, offshore/nearshore production strategies, and international facility locations using quantitative tools such as the Weighted-Score Method.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>Apply appropriate process designs, manufacturing process types (Project, Batch, Mass, Continuous), and facility layout configurations (Cellular, Product, Functional) to optimize shop-floor material flow and assembly line balancing.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Execute capacity planning, inventory management, and scheduling calculations using operational tools and metrics including Overall Equipment Effectiveness (OEE), Economic Order Quantity (EOQ), ABC Analysis, and Materials Requirements Planning (MRP) logic.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Formulate and propose operations improvement plans by applying Lean manufacturing philosophy (eliminating 7 Wastes/Muda, Value Stream Mapping), Total Quality Management (TQM), risk management, and recovery</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>CLO7</strong></td><td>Demonstrate the ability to produce a clear, structured academic written report and deliver an effective oral presentation analyzing international manufacturing setup and operational challenges.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td><strong>CLO8</strong></td><td>Practice effective teamwork, communication, and cross-cultural problem-solving skills to collaboratively design and manage complex global operations projects.</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14435\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14435</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14435\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14435</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
